ng\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Rod\"><img alt=\"Terra Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Rod_720f3f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bag of Apple Slices\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bag_of_Apple_Slices_1fd85a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Triangle tower\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Triangle_tower_2f6f5f.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Triangle Tower</b> is a daunting place to approach. Not much is known about its history, but there must be a fantastic story because of the variety of dangerous creatures that can be found there. On the top floor the masters of the tower can be found, a bizarre alliance of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witch</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monk</a>. To open triangle tower you use a switch in the desert. This switch is across the river from the tower, hidden beneath some rubble, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32573,32121,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32573, 32121, 7)</a>. It's a long walk to reach the switch, so you should check if the tower is open first. In case the tower is closed while you are inside, use the teleporter on the basement level to get out, but beware; there is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelord</a> down there as well. \n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/quest/triangle-tower-quest\">Triangle Tower Quest</a> takes place here, as well as Mission 5 of the <a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">What a Foolish Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Triangle Tower - Basement Floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\"><img alt=\"Bonelord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonelord_f12398.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">170</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">260</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">235 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">45 <span class=\"icon\"><spa